ers, tools trolley, spirit levels, cutting blades, and non-sparking tools. It also provides fiberglass handle steel axe, gear wrench combination spanner, impact driver socket set, crimping tool, flexible hacksaw blades, deep hole saw and arbors, silver series cut off wheel, and rotary barrel pump. It markets its products through distributors under the TAPARIA brand name. It exports its products to the United Kingdom, the United States, Denmark, Israel, Germany, Sweden, Norway, Finland, Dubai, Kuwait, Tanzania, Kenya, Hong Kong, Thailand, Mexico, Argentina, Uruguay, the United Arab Emirates, Sri Lanka, etc. Taparia Tools Limited was incorporated in 1965 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India."}}